{"3319700": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "新世界：暗影成双", "steam_appid": 3319700, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3319700/extras/12f494d9bae57ee39d3c95e99e718047.poster.avif?t=1787307226\" width=382 height=82 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3319700/extras/12f494d9bae57ee39d3c95e99e718047.webm?t=1787307226\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3319700/extras/12f494d9bae57ee39d3c95e99e718047.mp4?t=1787307226\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >欢迎来到《新世界：暗影成双》，这是我们在双人互动影游的又一次尝试。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >在这款游戏中，你将与另一位玩家化身为故事中的男女主角，携手并肩探索一个充满冒险与复杂情感的世界。</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >游戏特色：</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >丰富的剧情分支：多章节故事，多重分支选择，男女主角差异化的单人剧情，打造独一无二的故事体验。</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >多种双人互动玩法：包括剧情选择、双人QTE、拟真交互、场景探索、推理、解谜、双人射击等，合作与竞争并存。</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >《新世界：暗影成双》即将揭开一段权力、金钱和情感交织的双人冒险旅程。准备好了吗？赶紧将这款游戏加入心愿单，期待与你的伙伴们一起进入这个充满挑战和惊喜的新世界吧！</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >我们正在紧张地拍摄和制作中~接下来，我们将以图文、短视频等方式，不定期发布创作小故事，收集大家的建议，更有制作组直播、CDK抽奖等福利与大家分享。 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >欢迎关注我们的玩家群&amp;官方账号：</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >QQ群：489179785</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >B站/抖音：「新世界：暗影成双」</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3319700/extras/12f494d9bae57ee39d3c95e99e718047.poster.avif?t=1787307226\" width=382 height=82 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3319700/extras/12f494d9bae57ee39d3c95e